[{"text": "The assembly will now hear an address by", "start": 0.56, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "his excellency Justin Ensang Yumava,", "start": 2.879, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "Prime Minister of the Republic of", "start": 7.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Rwanda. I request protocol to escort his", "start": 9.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 12.48, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 15.2, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Uh, excellency Dr. Kaluru Rahham Naman,", "start": 46.079, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "president of the 81st [clears throat]", "start": 51.28, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "general assembly.", "start": 53.92, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Excellency Antonio Gutirez, Secretary", "start": 56.64, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "General of the United Nations.", "start": 60.16, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 63.68, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "heads of delegations,", "start": 65.439, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 67.439, "duration": 5.801}, {"text": "good evening.", "start": 70.0, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "On behalf of the government of Rwanda,", "start": 74.159, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "allow me to begin by congratulating His", "start": 78.24, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "Excellency Dr. Killu Raman on his", "start": 82.799, "duration": 9.521}, {"text": "election as president of the 81st", "start": 87.52, "duration": 8.959}, {"text": "session of the United Nations General", "start": 92.32, "duration": 7.159}, {"text": "Assembly.", "start": 96.479, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Rwanda also wishes to commend the", "start": 100.24, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "secretary general, his excellency", "start": 104.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Antonio Gutes", "start": 108.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "for the steady commitment", "start": 110.56, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "with which he has led this organization", "start": 113.68, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "through a period of extraordinary", "start": 117.84, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "strain.", "start": 121.84, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We reiterate our full support as he", "start": 125.6, "duration": 8.639}, {"text": "carries through the remainder of his", "start": 129.679, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "mandate.", "start": 134.239, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Last year", "start": 139.599, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "we gathered under the theme of better", "start": 141.84, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "together", "start": 146.959, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "marking 80 eight years since the charter", "start": 149.92, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "was signed", "start": 154.56, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "this year", "start": 158.239, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "under a new call to restore trust and", "start": 160.48, "duration": 9.52}, {"text": "deliver for all. We must be honest with", "start": 165.84, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "ourselves.", "start": 170.0, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "We are still far behind.", "start": 171.599, "duration": 5.241}, {"text": "The United Nations", "start": 178.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "has yet to demonstrate", "start": 180.8, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "that it can adapt to a changing and", "start": 183.92, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "uncertain world.", "start": 188.72, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "And it is up to member states to make", "start": 191.28, "duration": 9.0}, {"text": "this uh reality.", "start": 195.84, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "That gap is not abstract to Rwanda.", "start": 200.879, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "Three decades ago,", "start": 206.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "our country's future was also deeply", "start": 209.36, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "uncertain.", "start": 213.68, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "our survival dependent", "start": 217.12, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "on our capacity to rebuild", "start": 220.159, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "against all odds.", "start": 224.0, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "And what made that possible was a simple", "start": 226.56, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "principle and conviction that", "start": 230.959, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "institutions earn legitimacy", "start": 234.64, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "not by what they promise but by what", "start": 238.159, "duration": 9.8}, {"text": "they deliver year after year.", "start": 242.159, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "We believe this principle", "start": 248.319, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "holds to for the military system as a", "start": 251.12, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "whole and for the United Nations in", "start": 255.84, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "particular.", "start": 259.68, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "It is the standard against which reform", "start": 263.6, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "must be judged.", "start": 267.04, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Optimism,", "start": 270.479, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "however important it can be, must be", "start": 272.479, "duration": 8.801}, {"text": "matched by willingness to change how we", "start": 276.24, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "act.", "start": 281.28, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Too often,", "start": 285.44, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the United Nations has been more", "start": 287.919, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "effective", "start": 291.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "at responding to crisis than", "start": 292.96, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "anticipating them.", "start": 296.24, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "This is true of pandemics,", "start": 300.56, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "of climate shocks,", "start": 303.919, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "of techn technological disruption", "start": 306.4, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and it is nowhere more costly than in", "start": 310.16, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "conflicts.", "start": 314.4, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Eastern DRC is a clear example of that.", "start": 320.8, "duration": 9.119}, {"text": "For more than three decades,", "start": 326.88, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "the FDLR has spread genocidal ideology,", "start": 329.919, "duration": 11.681}, {"text": "committed grave abuses in eastern DRC,", "start": 336.0, "duration": 10.08}, {"text": "and directly threatened Rwanda security,", "start": 341.6, "duration": 10.68}, {"text": "including through crossber attacks.", "start": 346.08, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "It now operates", "start": 353.919, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "alongside Bundian troops and DLC", "start": 356.4, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "sponsored militias and mercenaries", "start": 360.08, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "in violation of the 1989 UN Convention", "start": 363.6, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "and the 1977", "start": 368.8, "duration": 8.28}, {"text": "OAU Convention against mercenaries.", "start": 371.28, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "And this does not happen overnight.", "start": 378.24, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "The roots of the conflict in eastern DRC", "start": 383.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "are political", "start": 386.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and they lie in longstanding grievances,", "start": 389.12, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "exclusion and failures of governance.", "start": 392.88, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "So the solution too", "start": 397.44, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "must be political.", "start": 400.08, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Rwanda", "start": 405.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "fully supports the diplomatic efforts", "start": 407.52, "duration": 8.44}, {"text": "underway to reach such a solution.", "start": 410.0, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "We commend the Washington Accords", "start": 417.199, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "between Rwanda and the DRC", "start": 420.4, "duration": 10.079}, {"text": "and the DHA process between the DRC and", "start": 424.88, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "AFCM23", "start": 430.479, "duration": 8.521}, {"text": "as steps in the right direction.", "start": 433.039, "duration": 5.961}, {"text": "We are grateful for the relentless", "start": 439.599, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "efforts", "start": 442.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "deployed by President Doddan Trump,", "start": 443.52, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "his highness the Amir of Qatar, Sheik", "start": 447.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Tamim bin Hammed Arti", "start": 451.36, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "and the African Union mediator,", "start": 454.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "President Fyasimbe of Togo", "start": 458.08, "duration": 8.44}, {"text": "in advancing these processes", "start": 461.68, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "And we remain committed to a region", "start": 467.199, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "where all countries can coexist", "start": 470.56, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "peacefully, where they can trade and", "start": 472.96, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "develop together.", "start": 476.319, "duration": 3.961}, {"text": "Rwanda calls on all actors,", "start": 482.639, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "including the Security Council,", "start": 486.56, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "to support these same peace efforts", "start": 490.639, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "fairly", "start": 493.52, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and to encourage all parties to honor", "start": 495.12, "duration": 7.639}, {"text": "their commitments.", "start": 499.36, "duration": 3.399}, {"text": "There is no lasting peace without", "start": 503.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "confronting the root causes of the", "start": 505.28, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "conflict and addressing the legitimate", "start": 508.24, "duration": 10.039}, {"text": "concerns of all those affected.", "start": 512.399, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 519.039, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "the value of prevention extends beyond", "start": 521.839, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "conflicts.", "start": 526.0, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "It also means", "start": 528.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "addressing the conditions that leave", "start": 531.2, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "countries vulnerable to poverty,", "start": 534.64, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "economic shocks, and exclusion from", "start": 537.76, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "opportunity.", "start": 542.0, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "An international system that gives all", "start": 545.839, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "countries a fair opportunity to", "start": 549.04, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "determine their own development pathways", "start": 552.64, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "must be central to the UN8 reform", "start": 556.16, "duration": 7.72}, {"text": "process.", "start": 560.88, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "The question before this assembly is not", "start": 564.08, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "whether multilateralism remains", "start": 568.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "relevant.", "start": 571.12, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "It is whether our institutions", "start": 573.839, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "are prepared to adapt to the challenges", "start": 578.48, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "of our century and to deliver results", "start": 582.24, "duration": 8.279}, {"text": "that matter.", "start": 586.88, "duration": 3.639}, {"text": "We welcome this session's emphasis on", "start": 591.12, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "restoring trust through prevention,", "start": 594.88, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "inclusion, and reform.", "start": 598.72, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "and we stand ready to work with all", "start": 602.16, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "member states towards that end.", "start": 606.0, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "I thank you.", "start": 610.64, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly,", "start": 633.12, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "I wish to thank the prime minister of", "start": 635.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "the Republic of Rwanda.", "start": 638.48, "duration": 3.28}]